1. Signal over noise
Post with sources, context, or informed questions. Low-effort reactions, memes, and drive-by takes will be removed.

2. Attack ideas, not people
Disagreement is expected. Harassment, slurs, dogpiling, or intimidation are not.

3. Stay on mission
This community exists for focused discussion of its core topic. Off-topic posting and general social chatter belong elsewhere.

4. No spam or growth tactics
No promotional campaigns, engagement farming, or irrelevant link-dropping. Share work only when it adds real value to the discussion.

5. Protect the working environment
Do not dox, expose private individuals, or share unverified claims. Bring evidence and act in good faith.
